  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership will use the 2021 grant to improve internal structures including revamping their monitoring system and structure, using a new digital structure for cooperation, and conducting an external evaluation. In addition the partners in Zambia and Malawi will conduct domestic exchanges with a total of 12 participants; 6 former participants and 6 newly recruited who will be on exchange in pairs. Their tasks will be to ensure sports activities to children and youth in the different locations, addressing through the activities gender equality, covid-19 safety measures and equality/inclusion measures.</narrative>
  </description>
